# Bundled YouTube OAuth client for one-click sign-in (Desktop-app type).
# Read at COMPILE time by src-tauri (option_env!), never committed with values.
# Dev: export before `npm run dev`. Release: set as CI secrets at build time.
# Without these the app still works — users enter their own keys in Settings.
# BSC_YOUTUBE_CLIENT_ID=
# BSC_YOUTUBE_CLIENT_SECRET=
